	<section_number>44-16</section_number>
	<catch_line>Records of Adjutant General</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Adjutant General shall keep a record of all officers and enlisted personnel, and shall also keep all records and papers required by law or regulations to be filed therein.
	</text>
	<history>1930, p. 951; Michie Code 1942, § 2673(13); R. P. 1948, § 44-15; 1970, c. 662; 2011, cc. 572, 586.</history>
